  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-24T15:37:17.323Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As a VRC+ subscriber, I feel like a fool when modded client users have better anti-crash resiliency than my paid official client. Some of the TOS-breaking anti-crash clients are even sold on a monthly recurring basis. I've sent VRChat staff the details on these mods via moderation tickets.\nIt is annoying and frustrating to get crashed by other users in VRChat, even with aggressive safety settings and particle limits. This should not be possible with any online game in 2021. The issue is made even worse when VRChat.exe exits uncleanly on crash and does not save output logs, or closes such that Steam still thinks it is running and won't re-launch without a Steam restart. Fix your broken game if you expect people to pay for it.",
